msgid "内核模块的系统集成实施计划"
msgstr "Kernel module system-integration implementation plan"

msgid ""
"状态：设计于 2026-10-24，系统集成功能实施与分层验收已完成。以下记录交付范围， 编译、打包和来宾验证分别说明；既有失败与未验证范围继续保留。父仓调查基线为 "
"``9f7ab3c11869056ac9ad9192e1c3ae682b4d57ec``。 内核机制和 K1-K8 阶段由 ReliefNT 仓库 "
"``Documentation/process/module-support-plan.rst`` 定义；本计划只持有 ReliefOS 配置、用户态、启动载荷、安装更新及验收编排。"
msgstr ""
"Status: designed on 2026-10-24; system-integration implementation and layered acceptance are "
"complete. This record describes delivered scope, with compilation, packaging, and guest validation"
" reported separately; existing failures and unverified areas remain documented. The parent-"
"repository investigation baseline is ``9f7ab3c11869056ac9ad9192e1c3ae682b4d57ec``. Kernel "
"mechanisms and stages K1-K8 are defined in ReliefNT's ``Documentation/process/module-support-"
"plan.rst``. This plan owns only ReliefOS configuration, userspace, boot payloads, "
"installation/update, and acceptance orchestration."

msgid ""
"用户已确认 .ko 采用 Linux 风格机制，但针对 ReliefNT 重新编译。 当前已授权实现；建立分支、提交或推送须另获明确授权。实施使用 executing-"
"plans；允许委派时使用用户指定的 GPT-6.1-Terra / Max。"
msgstr ""
"The user confirmed Linux-style .ko mechanisms, recompiled for ReliefNT. Implementation is "
"currently authorized; branch creation, commits, and pushes require separate explicit "
"authorization. Use executing-plans for implementation; when delegation is allowed, use the user-"
"specified GPT-6.1-Terra / Max."

msgid "系统行为契约"
msgstr "System behavior contract"

msgid ""
"``make O=... defconfig`` 明确重置 OS 配置，并对同一输出对应的内核 ``RELIEFNT_SUBBUILD_O`` 执行 defconfig；默认生产组件均为 y。"
msgstr ""
"``make O=... defconfig`` explicitly resets OS configuration and runs defconfig for the kernel's "
"``RELIEFNT_SUBBUILD_O`` corresponding to the same output; all production components default to y."

msgid ""
"``make kernel-menuconfig``、``kernel-olddefconfig``、``kernel-allmodconfig`` 委派到实际内核输出。OS menuconfig"
" 继续管理 OS 产品；不复制或导入内核 功能符号到主仓 Kconfig，也不把应用配置放进内核。"
msgstr ""
"``make kernel-menuconfig``, ``kernel-olddefconfig``, and ``kernel-allmodconfig`` delegate to the "
"actual kernel output. OS menuconfig continues to manage OS products; kernel feature symbols are "
"not copied or imported into this repository's Kconfig, and application configuration is not placed"
" in the kernel."

msgid "普通 make/all/kernel/image、自动 config-sync 和缺文件修复不能重置用户 的 m 设置。首次无配置时允许初始化默认配置，已有配置只同步新增选项。"
msgstr ""
"Normal make/all/kernel/image, automatic config-sync, and missing-file repair must not reset users'"
" m selections. Initial default configuration is allowed when none exists; existing configurations "
"only synchronize new options."

msgid ""
"镜像适配消费内核 install manifest，不扫描源码猜模块，也不在主仓再编译 内核对象。原 kernel.sys/debug、镜像输出位置保持，新增模块树与 initramfs。"
msgstr ""
"Image integration consumes the kernel install manifest; it neither scans sources to guess modules "
"nor recompiles kernel objects in this repository. Existing kernel.sys/debug and image output "
"locations remain, with module trees and initramfs added."

msgid "同一镜像中的内核、模块、模块数据库和 initramfs 必须属于同一 ABI 身份。 配置遗漏根设备驱动/FS、缺模块、错误版本须在打包阶段失败，不能交给启动试错。"
msgstr ""
"The kernel, modules, module database, and initramfs in one image must share an ABI identity. "
"Missing root-device drivers/filesystems, missing modules, or wrong versions must fail packaging "
"rather than be discovered by trial booting."

msgid "推荐启动链"
msgstr "Recommended boot chain"

msgid ""
"初版采用外置、未压缩 newc 档案，减少必须内置的解压依赖；压缩作为独立后续 功能，不提供当前无法使用的压缩选项。OS 镜像统一带一个小 initramfs，即使 "
"生产组件全内置也使用同一系统启动策略；内核自身仍可支持独立无 initramfs 启动。"
msgstr ""
"The first version uses an external uncompressed newc archive to reduce required built-in "
"decompression dependencies. Compression is a separate future feature; no currently unusable "
"compression options are exposed. OS images all include a small initramfs, using the same system "
"boot policy even with all production components built in. The kernel itself may still support "
"standalone boot without initramfs."

msgid ""
"早期用户态使用现有 musl/BusyBox，包含 /init、mount/switch_root/modprobe、 最小设备节点和当前内核启动依赖。普通镜像的初始根不包含完整桌面。 "
"安装/live 载荷仍是独立的大型文件系统模块：GRUB 同时传递 initramfs 和原有 安装根载荷，早期程序加载 FS 后从内存块设备挂载。不可把 ext4 镜像简单改名 成 "
"initramfs，或要求尚未可见的根分区提供读取它自己必需的驱动。"
msgstr ""
"Early userspace uses existing musl/BusyBox, including /init, mount/switch_root/modprobe, minimal "
"device nodes, and current kernel boot dependencies. A normal image's initial root does not contain"
" the full desktop. Installation/live payloads remain separate large filesystem modules: GRUB "
"passes both initramfs and the existing installation-root payload, and early userspace loads the FS"
" then mounts it from a memory block device. Do not merely rename an ext4 image to initramfs, or "
"require an invisible root partition to supply the driver needed to read itself."

msgid ""
"可移植发行镜像打包所选存储驱动和支持的根 FS 的模块依赖闭包；不能只根据 构建宿主机的硬件选择启动模块。root=PARTUUID 等根身份和 BIOS/UEFI loader "
"选择保持现有契约，不能随磁盘枚举顺序改变目标。"
msgstr ""
"Portable release images package the dependency closure of modules for selected storage drivers and"
" supported root filesystems; boot modules must not be selected solely from build-host hardware. "
"Existing root identity contracts such as root=PARTUUID and BIOS/UEFI loader selection remain; disk"
" enumeration order must not change the target."

msgid "工具与安装布局"
msgstr "Tools and installation layout"

msgid ""
"沿用现有 BusyBox 的 insmod、rmmod、lsmod、modinfo、modprobe、depmod。 设计调查时启用了 MODPROBE_SMALL，alias/symbol "
"配置关闭；实现已切换为 完整 modprobe/depmod 配置，验收覆盖依赖、别名、blacklist、参数与内置识别。 不新造一套同名私有工具，也不假定现有命令“存在”就已经能加载模块。"
msgstr ""
"Reuse BusyBox insmod, rmmod, lsmod, modinfo, modprobe, and depmod. At design investigation, "
"MODPROBE_SMALL was enabled and alias/symbol options disabled. Implementation switched to full "
"modprobe/depmod configuration; acceptance covers dependencies, aliases, blacklists, parameters, "
"and built-in detection. Do not invent private tools with the same names or assume an existing "
"command can already load modules merely because it exists."

msgid ""
"目标目录为 ``/lib/modules/<KERNELRELEASE>/``，数据库由目标兼容 depmod 离线生成；宿主 depmod 可读相同产物作为交叉检查，不假定宿主版本相同。 "
"宿主工具必须指定私有根，例如 ``depmod -b <staging> <KERNELRELEASE>``， 不得重写宿主的模块目录。还须检查 APK/BusyBox 的命令归属，避免分发时被 "
"另一个同名程序覆盖；最终镜像中的实际工具也要完成同一套读取和依赖测试。 静态配置遵循 ``/etc/modules-"
"load.d/*.conf``、``/etc/modprobe.d/*.conf``； 设备 coldplug 根据 sysfs modalias 加载。内核别名/依赖来自编译元数据，不在 OS "
"脚本里维护第二份 PCI ID 或依赖表。"
msgstr ""
"The target directory is ``/lib/modules/<KERNELRELEASE>/``; a target-compatible depmod generates "
"databases offline. Host depmod may read the same artifacts as a cross-check, without assuming "
"matching host versions. Host tools must specify a private root, for example ``depmod -b <staging> "
"<KERNELRELEASE>``, and must not rewrite host module directories. Check APK/BusyBox command "
"ownership to prevent same-name replacement in distribution; actual tools in the final image must "
"pass the same reading and dependency tests. Static configuration follows ``/etc/modules-"
"load.d/*.conf`` and ``/etc/modprobe.d/*.conf``; device coldplug loads from sysfs modalias. Kernel "
"aliases/dependencies come from compiled metadata, not a second PCI-ID or dependency table in OS "
"scripts."

msgid ""
"早期依赖在 /init 中加载；普通设备模块服务必须早于音频、网络和 Xorg。 不能靠固定 sleep 等待模块完成，完成条件应是 modprobe 返回与对应设备出现。 用户手动操作 root"
" 磁盘、挂载中的 FS、活跃 DRM/PCM 等模块时，安全拒绝卸载 属于预期行为；不能为“所有命令成功”而让系统继续使用被释放的代码。"
msgstr ""
"Load early dependencies in /init; normal device-module services must precede audio, network, and "
"Xorg. Do not wait using fixed sleeps: completion means modprobe returns and the relevant device "
"appears. Safe refusal to unload modules for the root disk, mounted filesystems, active DRM/PCM, "
"and similar resources during manual operations is expected. Never let the system use freed code "
"just to make every command succeed."

msgid "构建、安装和更新事务"
msgstr "Build, install, and update transactions"

msgid ""
"内核 install 扩展 manifest，至少公布 KERNELRELEASE、模块 ABI 身份、 模块路径/依赖/校验和、内置元数据、配置与 symvers。父仓构建图增加模块树 和 "
"initramfs 的完整前置依赖，m-y-n 切换、模块删除或配置变化均触发重建。 清理严格受产物 manifest 约束，不删除用户手工安装的模块和其他内核版本。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel install extends the manifest to publish at least KERNELRELEASE, module ABI identity, module"
" paths/dependencies/checksums, built-in metadata, configuration, and symvers. The parent build "
"graph adds complete prerequisites for module trees and initramfs; m-y-n transitions, module "
"deletion, and configuration changes trigger rebuilds. Cleanup is strictly bounded by artifact "
"manifests and must not delete manually installed modules or other kernel versions."

msgid ""
"内核 release 使用唯一 ABI 后缀，OS VERSION_ID 保持发行数字版本。 模块安装在版本目录，更新时可同时保留当前和新内核模块。 GRUB "
"仍提供既有公开入口；其版本入口精确绑定 kernel/initramfs 成对文件。 旧版本入口引用自己的内核、initramfs 和模块树。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel releases use unique ABI suffixes while OS VERSION_ID keeps the numeric release version. "
"Modules install in versioned directories, allowing current and new kernel modules to coexist "
"during updates. GRUB retains existing public entries; version entries bind exact kernel/initramfs "
"pairs. Old version entries reference their own kernel, initramfs, and module tree."

msgid ""
"父仓预生成可移植 initramfs，与相应内核和所选模块共同装入内核 APK/安装 载荷。Installer、普通系统更新和 RPR 使用同一套载荷校验/发布接口：先完整 "
"写入新版本模块、kernel、initramfs，校验并同步，再发布版本选择记录。 不能先删当前内核模块目录，也不能让旧内核指向新模块。 更换 BIOS/UEFI loader "
"选项不影响模块载荷配对与回滚。"
msgstr ""
"The parent repository pregenerates a portable initramfs and packages it with the matching kernel "
"and selected modules into the kernel APK/installation payload. Installer, normal updates, and RPR "
"share payload validation/publication interfaces: fully write new-version modules, kernel, and "
"initramfs, verify and sync, then publish the version-selection record. Never delete current kernel"
" modules first or point an old kernel to new modules. BIOS/UEFI loader changes do not affect "
"module-payload pairing or rollback."

msgid "明确的提交点与故障模型"
msgstr "Explicit commit points and fault model"

msgid ""
"不能把 ESP/FAT 上的临时文件加 rename 当作整套更新的断电原子保证。 日常内核更新不重写稳定的 GRUB 入口，采用预分配的 A/B 选择槽：每槽包含 固定尺寸的版本描述文件与独立 "
"SHA-256 校验文件，各自引用不可变版本载荷。 更新只写非当前槽；先同步载荷，再同步完整描述，最后写入并同步该槽校验。 槽从校验失败转为校验成功就是新版本的发布条件，不另写单点 active "
"指针。"
msgstr ""
"Temporary files plus rename on ESP/FAT do not guarantee power-loss atomicity for an entire update."
" Routine kernel updates leave stable GRUB entries untouched and use preallocated A/B selection "
"slots. Each slot contains a fixed-size version descriptor and separate SHA-256 checksum file "
"referencing immutable version payloads. Updates write only the noncurrent slot: sync payloads, "
"then the complete descriptor, then write and sync the slot checksum. A slot transitioning from "
"invalid to valid checksum publishes the new version; no separate single-point active pointer is "
"written."

msgid ""
"稳定 GRUB 脚本先校验槽，再读取其受限版本/递增序号；选择校验有效且序号 最高的完整版本，同时保留旧版本菜单。解析有界且只允许预定字段/路径， 不能在校验前 source 描述文件。内核与 "
"initramfs 的哈希也要校验。 两平台 GRUB 模块清单补齐原版 hashsum/SHA-256 所需组件，不写自定义引导协议。 "
"首次安装预分配两个槽；已有系统迁移保留旧入口，确认新入口后才启用槽选择。"
msgstr ""
"The stable GRUB script verifies slots before reading their restricted version/increasing sequence "
"fields. It selects the complete valid slot with the highest sequence and retains old-version "
"menus. Parsing is bounded and permits only predefined fields/paths; descriptors must not be "
"sourced before verification. Kernel and initramfs hashes are also checked. Both platforms' GRUB "
"module lists include upstream hashsum/SHA-256 dependencies; no custom boot protocol is introduced."
" Initial installation preallocates both slots. Migration preserves old entries and enables slot "
"selection only after confirming the new entry."

msgid ""
"断电验收模型是任一步写入/同步失败、未同步写入丢失，以及正在写的非当前槽 记录撕裂：校验失败应回退到最后完整槽。设备丢失已同步数据、任意 FAT 元数据 损坏、更新固件/MBR/EFI "
"本体不属于“内核包原子更新”的可证明范围，必须另行 报告；不承诺跨文件系统/固件的绝对断电原子性。"
msgstr ""
"The power-loss acceptance model covers failure of any write/sync, loss of unsynced writes, and "
"torn records in the noncurrent slot being written. Invalid checksums must fall back to the last "
"complete slot. Devices losing synced data, arbitrary FAT metadata corruption, and firmware/MBR/EFI"
" executable updates are outside the provable scope of atomic kernel-package updates and must be "
"reported separately. Absolute power-loss atomicity across filesystems/firmware is not promised."

msgid "阶段与执行检查"
msgstr "Stages and execution checks"

msgid "O1：双仓配置委派"
msgstr "O1: configuration delegation across both repositories"

msgid ""
"依赖 K1。修改 ``scripts/reliefos/Makefile.config``、``Makefile.kernel`` 与 帮助文本；新增 ``tests/build/test-"
"kernel-config-delegation.sh``。"
msgstr ""
"Depends on K1. Modify ``scripts/reliefos/Makefile.config``, ``Makefile.kernel``, and help text; "
"add ``tests/build/test-kernel-config-delegation.sh``."

msgid ""
"[x] 先以可记录参数的 fake 子 make 测试同一 ARCH/PROFILE/绝对 O= 的委派， 覆盖新输出、defconfig 重置、普通构建保留 m、用户覆盖 RELIEFNT_O。"
msgstr ""
"[x] First test delegation with the same ARCH/PROFILE/absolute O= using a fake child make that "
"records arguments, covering new outputs, defconfig reset, preserving m in normal builds, and user "
"RELIEFNT_O overrides."

msgid ""
"[x] 接入三个 kernel 配置目标；将 defconfig 的 OS/内核操作有序执行， 不并行竞争同一配置输出，也不引入 parent/child KCONFIG_CONFIG 环境串用。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Wire up three kernel configuration targets; run OS/kernel defconfig steps in order, without "
"parallel races on the same configuration output or parent/child KCONFIG_CONFIG environment cross-"
"contamination."

msgid "[x] 使用真实两仓 conf/mconf 再验证默认全内置与配置持久化。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Revalidate default all-built-in behavior and configuration persistence with real conf/mconf in"
" both repositories."

msgid "O2：模块产物、用户工具与 initramfs"
msgstr "O2: module artifacts, userspace tools, and initramfs"

msgid ""
"依赖 K2-K4、K6a/K6b、K7。修改 ``Makefile.kernel``、``Makefile.rootfs``、BusyBox 配置；新增 "
"``tools/build/modules-stage.sh``、``initramfs-stage.sh``、 ``system/initramfs/init`` 和相应构建入口。"
msgstr ""
"Depends on K2-K4, K6a/K6b, and K7. Modify ``Makefile.kernel``, ``Makefile.rootfs``, and BusyBox "
"configuration; add ``tools/build/modules-stage.sh``, ``initramfs-stage.sh``, "
"``system/initramfs/init``, and build entry points."

msgid ""
"[x] 增加 ``test-kernel-modules-stage.sh`` 与 ``test-initramfs-stage.sh``： 空模块集、依赖闭包、缺文件、错 "
"ABI、档案可复现、受控清理和 m-y-n 切换。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Add ``test-kernel-modules-stage.sh`` and ``test-initramfs-stage.sh``: empty module sets, "
"dependency closure, missing files, wrong ABI, reproducible archives, controlled cleanup, and m-y-n"
" transitions."

msgid ""
"[x] 构建原生 BusyBox，读取真实 .modinfo/dep 数据库，测试别名、built-in no-op、blacklist、参数及多层依赖；不能只用假的 modprobe "
"输出断言成功。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Build native BusyBox, read actual .modinfo/dep databases, and test aliases, built-in no-ops, "
"blacklists, parameters, and multilevel dependencies; fake modprobe output alone cannot assert "
"success."

msgid ""
"[x] /init 挂载 proc/sys/dev、加载启动模块、解析根身份、等待有界设备发现、 挂载真实根并 exec 新 init。支持 rdinit= 诊断；失败提供明确的早期诊断入口。"
msgstr ""
"[x] /init mounts proc/sys/dev, loads boot modules, resolves root identity, waits for bounded "
"device discovery, mounts the real root, and execs the new init. Support rdinit= diagnostics and an"
" explicit early diagnostic entry on failure."

msgid "[x] 引入 early/normal 模块加载顺序；不让普通服务在模块未准备好时启动。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Introduce early/normal module-loading order; normal services must not start before modules are"
" ready."

msgid "O3：ISO、VMDK 与安装器载荷"
msgstr "O3: ISO, VMDK, and installer payloads"

msgid ""
"依赖 K5-K7、O2。修改 ``boot/grub/grub.cfg``、 ``scripts/reliefos/Makefile.images``、``tools/build/{boot-"
"stage,iso,images,installer-stage}.sh``、 ``userland/apps/installer/install_ops.c`` 和载荷检查。"
msgstr ""
"Depends on K5-K7 and O2. Modify ``boot/grub/grub.cfg``, ``scripts/reliefos/Makefile.images``, "
"``tools/build/{boot-stage,iso,images,installer-stage}.sh``, "
"``userland/apps/installer/install_ops.c``, and payload checks."

msgid ""
"[x] 为 BIOS/UEFI、磁盘/普通 ISO/Installer ISO 添加一致的 Multiboot2 initramfs 项，正确区分安装根载荷与初始根。检查安装器 "
"Xorg/控制台两种载荷。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Add consistent Multiboot2 initramfs entries for BIOS/UEFI and disk/normal ISO/Installer ISO, "
"correctly distinguishing installation-root payloads from initial root. Check both installer Xorg "
"and console payloads."

msgid "[x] 打包前验证必需功能 n 的非法 profile、根驱动/FS 为 m 的依赖闭包、 模块版本、kernel/initramfs 哈希与解包内容。禁止静默改成 y。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Before packaging, validate illegal profiles with required features set to n, dependency "
"closure when root driver/FS=m, module versions, kernel/initramfs hashes, and unpacked contents. "
"Never silently change settings to y."

msgid "[x] 分别测试全内置、混合及 allmodconfig 产物，既有输出文件地址不改变。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Test all-built-in, mixed, and allmodconfig artifacts separately, preserving existing output "
"file locations."

msgid "O4：更新、RPR 与恢复"
msgstr "O4: updates, RPR, and recovery"

msgid ""
"依赖 O3。修改 ``userland/runtime/src/bootloader{,_publish}.c``、 "
"``scripts/reliefos/Makefile.rpr``、``tools/build/rpr-pages.sh`` 及 APK 内核载荷。"
msgstr ""
"Depends on O3. Modify ``userland/runtime/src/bootloader{,_publish}.c``, "
"``scripts/reliefos/Makefile.rpr``, ``tools/build/rpr-pages.sh``, and APK kernel payloads."

msgid ""
"[x] 新增 ``tools/test_kernel_bundle.py``，验证完整发布、缺模块拒绝、短写、 同步/校验失败、各发布边界中断、双槽记录撕裂、启动前校验回退，以及旧 "
"入口和旧模块树保留；以私有镜像和明确故障模型注入，不改宿主磁盘。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Add ``tools/test_kernel_bundle.py`` to validate complete publication, missing-module "
"rejection, short writes, sync/checksum failures, interruptions at publication boundaries, torn "
"dual-slot records, pre-boot verification fallback, and preservation of old entries/module trees. "
"Inject faults in private images under an explicit fault model without changing host disks."

msgid "[x] 用同一发布接口绑定新版本三件套；只写非当前槽，成功前不改旧选择记录。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Bind the new version's three artifacts through the same publication interface; write only the "
"noncurrent slot and leave old selection records unchanged until success."

msgid "[x] RPR 元数据同时记录所需内核 ABI 和模块清单；发布 guard 继续要求 子仓 clean 且 gitlink 一致。不得因模块产物增加而跳过该规则。"
msgstr ""
"[x] RPR metadata records both required kernel ABI and module manifests. Publication guards still "
"require a clean subrepository matching the gitlink; additional module artifacts must not bypass "
"this rule."

msgid "O5：全链运行矩阵与文档"
msgstr "O5: end-to-end runtime matrix and documentation"

msgid "新增 ``tools/test_kernel_modules_qemu.py`` 编排器，消费内核拥有的模块和 原生探针；只操作私有 VM/镜像与短路径 QMP socket。"
msgstr ""
"Add ``tools/test_kernel_modules_qemu.py`` orchestration, consuming kernel-owned modules and native"
" probes and operating only on private VMs/images and short-path QMP sockets."

msgid "[x] defconfig 全内置、部分模块、allmodconfig，以及 MODULES=n 全内置。"
msgstr "[x] defconfig all-built-in, partial modules, allmodconfig, and MODULES=n all-built-in."

msgid ""
"[x] BIOS 与 UEFI；1 和 4 vCPU；分别以 IDE/ATAPI、AHCI、NVMe 为根， 至少覆盖 ext4 与可支持的其他根 FS；Installer/live "
"的内存根另外验证。"
msgstr ""
"[x] BIOS and UEFI; 1 and 4 vCPUs; IDE/ATAPI, AHCI, and NVMe roots, covering at least ext4 and "
"other supported root filesystems. Validate Installer/live memory roots separately."

msgid "[x] 最关键门槛：根控制器=m、根 FS=m，最终出现真实桌面并可读写文件。 不是只看到 GRUB、启动日志或 /init 探针就算成功。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Critical gate: root controller=m and root FS=m must reach a real desktop with "
"readable/writable files. Seeing GRUB, boot logs, or an /init probe alone is insufficient."

msgid ""
"[x] e1000 联网和数据校验；声卡 PCM 的 open/mmap/close；Xorg/IceWM 的 DRM/fbdev 路径；内置/模块行为一致。QEMU 无 SVGA3D 不能冒充 "
"VMware 通过。"
msgstr ""
"[x] e1000 networking and data validation; sound-card PCM open/mmap/close; Xorg/IceWM DRM/fbdev "
"paths; equivalent built-in/module behavior. QEMU without SVGA3D cannot count as a VMware pass."

msgid "[x] 多层依赖装卸、内置 modprobe、重复加载、故意缺依赖/错版本文件的 错误诊断、busy 卸载拒绝、空闲装卸循环、进程/映射/IRQ 并发持有。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Multilevel dependency load/unload, built-in modprobe, repeated loading, diagnostics for "
"deliberately missing dependencies/wrong-version files, busy-unload rejection, idle load/unload "
"loops, and concurrent process/mapping/IRQ references."

msgid ""
"[x] 以相同 release profile 记录 yes/dd、启动耗时与桌面操作延迟对比； 出现稳定明显退化先定位，不能把性能损失归因于“模块本来就慢”。 同一 BIOS/1 "
"vCPU/AHCI/4 GiB 的 QEMU/KVM 平台上，预热后各五次 2 GiB yes/dd，中位数约为 default 2.755 GB/s、全模块 2.749 GB/s； 比值为 "
"0.9979，差异在本次样本波动范围内。普通启动及 VT 切换记录 只是单次观察，不能当作统计延迟结论；缺少同环境改造前基线，不声称 相对旧内核全面无性能退化。PIIX/IDE 无 "
"initramfs 的直接根 已通过桌面与声卡验证，但冷启动仍慢。实际 VMware 的 HDA、DRM 各八轮 生命周期及普通桌面十轮 Fileman/VT 验证通过；真实物理硬件尚未验证。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Record yes/dd, boot time, and desktop-operation latency comparisons with the same release "
"profile. Investigate stable significant regressions; do not dismiss losses as modules being "
"inherently slow. On the same BIOS/1 vCPU/AHCI/4 GiB QEMU/KVM platform, five warmed-up 2 GiB yes/dd"
" runs each yielded medians of about 2.755 GB/s for default and 2.749 GB/s for all-modular, a "
"0.9979 ratio within this sample's variation. Normal-boot and VT-switch records are single "
"observations, not statistical latency conclusions. Without a pre-change baseline in the same "
"environment, no claim of universally unchanged performance against the old kernel is made. "
"PIIX/IDE direct root without initramfs passed desktop and sound-card validation but still boots "
"slowly from cold. Real VMware passed eight HDA and DRM lifecycle rounds each and ten ordinary-"
"desktop Fileman/VT rounds; physical hardware remains unverified."

msgid "[x] 更新两仓职责对应的构建/安装/ABI/驱动文档与 RPR 说明，清除失效静态 假设；保留有明确用途的全内置独立启动路径与历史发布事实。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Update build/install/ABI/driver documentation and RPR notes according to each repository's "
"responsibilities, removing invalid static assumptions while retaining purposeful all-built-in "
"standalone boot paths and historical release facts."

msgid "安装验收的实际范围"
msgstr "Actual installation acceptance scope"

msgid ""
"全模块媒体的控制台、中文桌面两套实际安装盘均已分别从 BIOS、UEFI 启动； BIOS 完成普通用户登录，桌面版实际显示 IceWM 与 Fileman，UEFI 到达对应 "
"登录界面。离线检查两盘文件系统、UID 1000 账户、全部 41 项内核载荷及其中 24 个模块的路径、大小与哈希；模块包括 18 个生产模块和 6 个验收模块。 默认全内置、混合与 "
"MODULES=n 的普通运行由各自配置的运行矩阵验证， 不能把这两次全模块新安装扩大表述为四种配置均完成了全新安装。"
msgstr ""
"Both actual all-modular installation disks, console and Chinese desktop, booted separately under "
"BIOS and UEFI. BIOS reached normal-user login and the desktop version actually displayed IceWM and"
" Fileman; UEFI reached the corresponding login screens. Offline checks covered both filesystems, "
"UID 1000 accounts, and paths, sizes, and hashes of all 41 kernel payload items, including 24 "
"modules: 18 production and six acceptance modules. Default all-built-in, mixed, and MODULES=n "
"normal runs were validated by their own runtime matrices; these two all-modular fresh "
"installations do not establish fresh-install validation of all four configurations."

msgid ""
"原 2400 秒安装速度门禁仍失败。独立功能长测实际完成桌面安装后，因全量 约 6 MB 日志经串口读取超时而失败，原结果未改判通过。取证工具已改为读取 "
"有界末尾、使用本次请求标志并检查读取状态，宿主回归与真实来宾正负例通过； 已有安装盘再经独立双固件启动和完整离线检查验收。工具修正后没有重跑完整 安装复制，不作为安装提速证据。功能长测的 7200"
" 秒设置只是等待循环截止， 单次取帧或完成确认可以越界，并非绝对时间墙。"
msgstr ""
"The original 2400-second installation-speed gate still fails. A separate functional long test "
"completed desktop installation but failed when reading roughly 6 MB of full logs over serial timed"
" out; the original result was not reclassified as a pass. Evidence collection now reads a bounded "
"tail, uses a per-request marker, and checks read status; host regressions and positive/negative "
"real-guest cases passed. Existing installed disks then passed independent dual-firmware boot and "
"complete offline checks. Full installation copying was not rerun after the tooling fix, so it is "
"not evidence of faster installation. The long test's 7200-second setting only bounds the wait "
"loop; a frame capture or completion check may overrun it, so it is not an absolute wall-time "
"limit."

msgid "新版 Installer 的 VMware 验证未完成，真实物理硬件未验证；上述内核 VMware 运行结果与 Installer 安装验证分别记录。"
msgstr ""
"VMware validation of the new Installer is incomplete, and physical hardware is unverified. The "
"kernel's VMware runtime results above are recorded separately from Installer installation "
"validation."

msgid ""
"交付证据分源码检查、宿主测试、编译打包、QEMU、VMware与真实硬件记录， 每个运行结果绑定内核、模块与 initramfs 的精确哈希。 既有宿主失败、ABI golden 决策与音频 "
"manifest 决策独立记录，不静默改写。 VMware 验证未完成时必须明示；实现与运行结果按实际完成的阶段分别记录。"
msgstr ""
"Delivery evidence separates source inspection, host tests, compilation/packaging, QEMU, VMware, "
"and physical hardware records. Every runtime result is bound to exact kernel, module, and "
"initramfs hashes. Existing host failures, ABI golden decisions, and audio-manifest decisions are "
"recorded independently and never silently rewritten. Incomplete VMware validation must be "
"explicit; implementation and runtime results are recorded by the stages actually completed."

msgid "参考"
msgstr "References"

msgid "`Linux Kbuild 模块安装 <https://docs.kernel.org/kbuild/modules.html>`_"
msgstr "`Linux Kbuild module installation <https://docs.kernel.org/kbuild/modules.html>`_"

msgid "`Linux 早期用户态与 initramfs <https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/ramfs-rootfs-initramfs.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Linux early userspace and initramfs <https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/ramfs-rootfs-"
"initramfs.html>`_"
